 *   **Density Field:** `shape = smoothstep(1.2, 0.6, sphere) * flatBottom`, where `sphere = length(vec3(q.x, q.y * 0.55, q.z))`, `flatBottom = smoothstep(-0.2, 0.0, q.y)`, `q = (p - cloudCenter) / cloudRadius` [S1, unofficial].
