 ## Background
-Volumetric cloud rendering has evolved from simple billboards to complex raymarched density fields [S3, unofficial]. Modern real-time implementations often use 3D noise textures (Perlin, Worley) combined with raymarching to approximate atmospheric scattering [S3, unofficial].
